<section class="seo-hero"><div class="container seo-hero-grid">
<div class="seo-hero-copy"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/use-cases/">Professional learning</a><span>/</span><span>HubSpot certification</span></div><span class="seo-kicker">HubSpot Academy notes in Chrome</span><h1>Turn certification lessons into notes you can use at work.</h1><p>Audicap captures supported HubSpot Academy lesson audio as live text, helping you move from course frameworks to campaign checklists, implementation notes, and later review.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=hubspot_hero">Start with 30 free minutes <span>→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#workflow">See the workflow ↓</a></div><p class="seo-microcopy">No monthly subscription · Keep using the HubSpot Academy player · Independent of HubSpot</p></div>
<div class="plugin-preview-wrap"><div aria-label="Audicap Chrome extension interface preview with sample HubSpot Academy transcription" class="plugin-preview" role="img">
<div class="plugin-preview-header"><strong class="plugin-preview-logo">Audicap</strong><div class="plugin-preview-header-actions"><span class="plugin-credit-pill">◆ 105 credits</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="plugin-settings-button">⚙</span></div></div>
<div class="plugin-preview-main"><div class="plugin-capture-panel"><div class="plugin-capture-status"><span class="plugin-recording-dot"></span><div class="plugin-capture-copy"><strong>Recording this tab</strong><small>Capturing this tab. 6 min used.</small></div></div><span class="plugin-stop-button">Stop Recording</span></div>
<div class="plugin-tab-audio"><span class="plugin-audio-dot"></span><div><strong>Chrome tab audio detected</strong><small>Content Strategy · Lesson 5</small></div></div>
<div class="plugin-workspace-tabs"><span class="plugin-workspace-tab active">Live</span><span class="plugin-workspace-tab">History <i class="plugin-history-count">9</i></span></div>
